    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\"><span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span><span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Binary search (rotated)</span><a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/find-minimum-in-rotated-sorted-array/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 153</a></div>\n  <h1>Find Minimum in Rotated Sorted Array</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Insight in one line: compare the middle with the <em>last</em> value, never the first. Bigger means the drop is to the right (lo = mid + 1); smaller means mid..hi is sorted and mid may be the answer (hi = mid). O(log n) time, O(1) space.</p>\n"
